[{"title":"冬日都中杂咏 其三","author":"张晋","text":"人生论聚散，有如天上云。\n风吹无端合，亦复无故分。\n荔浦我好友，频年感离群。\n谁知因索米，复此共论文。\n此游亦偶然，此会知难久。\n莫问后日期，且共樽前酒。\n相期各努力，好秘千金帚。\n悠悠世上名，无用等刍狗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37842,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬日都中杂咏 其四","author":"张晋","text":"羁心念乡国，昨日家书至。\n仓卒视封缄，上有平安字。\n书中何所言？\n读罢长歔欷。\n缕缕述饥寒，此亦意中事。\n年来叹飘泊，偪仄情难舒。\n修名苦不立，回首惭妻拿。\n心怀千岁忧，身无一日好。\n何不随仙人，山中拾瑶草。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37843,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题周昭著独鲤朝天图","author":"张晋","text":"浮云扫尽天门开，海波上卷银花飞。\n泥鳅涸鲋泣水底，三十六鳞昂首来。\n半身搅波半在水，作势欲起不遽起。\n双眸炯炯射向天，万里晴空荡金紫。\n此时真宰亦应愁，直挟海水排天流。\n坐上宾客色齐沮，若实见此奈何许。\n蹭蹬穷波直到今，高堂看画独沉吟。\n年来谁借蹄涔水，空有乘风破浪心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37844,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬日京邸闻樊梅轩六基先生讣音","author":"张晋","text":"落拓还家独掩扉，唾壶敲缺赏音稀。\n几人富贵矜华屋，此老平生祗布衣。\n白发垂肩仍作达，黄金到手已全挥。\n伤心斜日逢庚子，能否魂招雪夜归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37845,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"复雪","author":"张晋","text":"归心与飞雪，历乱不能休。\n人卧袁安巷，寒凋季子裘。\n无言对樽酒，何处理箜篌。\n故国梅花好，还应笑远游。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37846,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"兕觥归赵歌并序","author":"张晋","text":"丈夫许国当不朽，安问剖心与碎首。\n丈夫即贬宜缄口，此时只合饮醇酒。\n君不见，文毅在昔官编修，文章气节无与俦。\n一朝目击夺情事，建言不为身家谋。\n可怜疏人忤时相，罢官得罪予廷杖。\n当年直道虽未行，朝野莫不闻其名。\n单车萧然出都去，阻道者谁颎阳生。\n跪奉兕觥把君手，殷勤愿为君子寿。\n神豸原能逐众邪，文羊何必输中卣。\n此兕流传二百年，归黄归陈亦屡迁。\n身历沧桑阅朝市，天令鬼守非虚言。\n珍藏更有章太史，后乃卒归颜氏子。\n传闻赵氏有孤孙，每诵铭言泪如水。\n覃溪学士今词宗，以诗为介遗颜公。\n千里持归告家庙，宝之直与璠玙同。\n伊余偶作长安客，摩挲新图重太息。\n区区一觥何足言，中有忠臣旧精魄。\n觥纵不归人亦宝，觥归乃见孤孙好。\n作歌下拜情未舒，恨不见觥惟见图。\n对酒挑灯更展玩，纸上生棱墨花灿，夜夜虹光射霄汉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37847,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其一 刘盆子","author":"张晋","text":"刮席不敢视，庸庸笑尔曹。\n怪他当璧者，日逐牧儿遨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37848,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其二 荐段襄","author":"张晋","text":"君叔真信士，慷慨事戎行。\n按刃书遗表，犹能荐段襄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37849,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其三 冯公孙","author":"张晋","text":"麦饭与豆粥，仓卒蒙褒赞。\n臣怀巾车恩，君念河北难。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37850,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其四 小儿曹","author":"张晋","text":"大耿初落落，其志竟能遂。\n谁知小儿曹，而乃有大意。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37851,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其五 遂前跸","author":"张晋","text":"壮哉铫次况，勇略罕其匹。\n请闲有深谋，一笑遂前跸。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37852,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其六 祭征虏","author":"张晋","text":"一为军市令，格杀舍中儿。\n安得祭征虏，群臣惭可知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37853,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其七 窦安丰","author":"张晋","text":"子阳思窃帝，季孟亦称雄。\n尉佗何足效，独有窦安丰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37854,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其八 茧栗犊","author":"张晋","text":"赵氏有孤孙，信义着夙昔。\n如何名家驹，误认茧栗犊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37855,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其九 一匹缣","author":"张晋","text":"仲回鄙大侠，赙助故从廉。\n不爱二千斛，乃怀一匹缣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37856,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其十 故功曹","author":"张晋","text":"权度廉颇后，平生行谊高。\n辞君君莫恨，终识故功曹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37857,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其十一 赤帷裳","author":"张晋","text":"贾父来何晚，歌谣遍道傍。\n由来贤刺史，羞闭赤帷裳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37858,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其十二 内外宠","author":"张晋","text":"通期生伯玉，几致无遗种。\n秦宫尔何人，乃兼内外宠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37859,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其十三 应中远","author":"张晋","text":"孔门考四科，官阀深可鄙。\n何争应中远，北面称弟子。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37860,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其十四 贾景伯","author":"张晋","text":"君山不读谶，高识足千秋。\n康成犹未免，景伯又何尤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37861,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其十五 篣妇公","author":"张晋","text":"回黄与转绿，颠倒亦何穷。\n三娶皆孤女，人言篣妇公。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37862,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其十六 东平王","author":"张晋","text":"处家慕为善，最乐无过此。\n大哉宪王言，副是要腹矣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37863,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其十七 三书生","author":"张晋","text":"郡公平楚狱，福宜及后嗣。\n岂真三书生，而能古葬地。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37864,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其十八 班定远","author":"张晋","text":"班生具异相，欲效傅介子。\n当其投笔时，志已在万里。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37865,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其十九 因树屋","author":"张晋","text":"申屠有远见，党祸不能覆。\n绝迹梁砀间，因树以为屋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37866,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其二十 夕阳亭","author":"张晋","text":"慷慨杨夫子，关西旧典型。\n空怜致大鸟，流恨夕阳亭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37867,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其二十一 陈廷尉","author":"张晋","text":"操笔定大议，我慕陈廷尉。\n捣椒而自随，李咸太无谓。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37868,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其二十二 马季长","author":"张晋","text":"季长号大儒，附梁亦堪丑。\n太息李公罪，乃成干卿手。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37869,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其二十三 帝不谛","author":"张晋","text":"咄咄白马令，上书用露布。\n直云帝不谛，何怪人主怒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37870,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其二十四 弃凉州","author":"张晋","text":"利器宜盘错，升卿负壮猷。\n谋臣皆肉食，何事弃凉州。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37871,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其二十五 傅南容","author":"张晋","text":"汉阳傅太守，抗节守孤城。\n别成须自勉，杨会即程婴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37872,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其二十六 二烈士","author":"张晋","text":"不共将军生，甘与臧洪死。\n可怜一日中，乃戮二烈士。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37873,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其二十七 蔡中郎","author":"张晋","text":"善人国之纪，制作国之典。\n司徒恶谤书，中郎竟不免。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37874,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其二十八 皇甫规","author":"张晋","text":"宦寺厄名贤，党祸亦可虑。\n当时皇甫规，竟耻不得豫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37875,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其二十九 祭皋陶","author":"张晋","text":"三木囊头日，艰危气不挠。\n死当配夷叔，生岂祭皋陶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37876,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其三十 张元节","author":"张晋","text":"望门覆人宗，元节何足议。\n远惭杜伯坚，近愧夏子治。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37877,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其三十一 茅季伟","author":"张晋","text":"杀鸡不供客，世俗定相怪。\n如乡贤乎哉，值得林宗拜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37878,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其三十二 荀文若","author":"张晋","text":"文若佐阿瞒，帷幄着奇绩。\n既为张子房，何乃阻九锡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37879,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其三十三 仇季智","author":"张晋","text":"季智化陈元，鸣枭诵声作。\n群看鸾凤祥，终胜鹰鹯虐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37880,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其三十四 一笥饵","author":"张晋","text":"南阳樊仲华，尘埃识天子。\n拔作都尉官，用酬一笥饵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37881,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其三十五 十九侯","author":"张晋","text":"定策西钟下，同时十九侯。\n江陵谁废置，皆出寺人谋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37882,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其三十六 范巨卿","author":"张晋","text":"遥遥一千里，生死见交情。\n执绋者谁子，山阳范巨卿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37883,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其三十七 善在此","author":"张晋","text":"次孙本人奴，独行古莫比。\n泣呼君夫人，敬告善在此。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37884,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《后汉书》作小乐府三十八章 其三十八 断车靷","author":"张晋","text":"拔刀断车靷，老成有远见。\n觥觥郭子横，乃入《方术传》。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37885,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"正月十六夜同荔浦天桥看月追和黄仲则陈理堂","author":"张晋","text":"月正十五至十七，游人看灯不看月。\n僻地谁来访素娥，空使寒光照冰雪。\n天桥高高接天坛，流波冻合澜不翻。\n栖鸦踏枝倏惊起，一轮皓魄明林端。\n初在林端既天半，倒影射桥光凌乱。\n此身疑作广寒游，十丈京尘一时散。\n延生与我怀抱同，深宵蹑足凌长虹。\n碧天沉沉净如拭，繁星敛耀芒角空。\n举头望月开口笑，作歌酬月月知否。\n黄生陈生皆清才，往年今夕曾同来。\n兴酣落笔走珠玉，欲与明月争光辉。\n太息后来无继矣，岂知更有我与子。\n君才何必输两人，月光不过清如此。\n此时旅怀百不忧，入关毕竟让王师。\n姓符谶纬原无应，身作韩彭且不知。\n欲效安丰何反复，可怜终未处台司。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37886,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"屈突通","author":"张晋","text":"办死批鳞气亦豪，奉身严正肃清高。\n服葱颇记歌三斗，摩颈何曾受一刀。\n故主难忘嗟未必，家僮虽斩笑徒劳。\n平生大节都无取，论赞犹蒙特笔褒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37887,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"封伦","author":"张晋","text":"太息封郎本佞臣，揣摩迎合费精神。\n两端竟可欺明主，此辈真惭号士人。\n死遇唐临难自料，生排萧瑀亦何因。\n削官改谥褫奸魄，国法聊从地下申。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37888,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"长孙赵公无忌","author":"张晋","text":"拥戴当年志不摇，可怜积毁骨能销。\n精诚岂肯同王凤，逼迫无端等薄昭。\n绫锦虚劳颁内帑，画图真可冠诸僚。\n伤心万里黔州路，惨淡忠魂孰与招。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37889,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"马仆射周","author":"张晋","text":"好学曾传善说《诗》，少年落拓不求知。\n拂衣刺史心何壮，暂馆中郎遇亦奇。\n已死尚烦方士觅，在生难免里人嗤。\n鸢肩火色原无憾，似此遭逢更有谁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37890,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"褚河南遂良","author":"张晋","text":"松柏凌寒挺劲姿，清风大节有谁知。\n艳妻一自煽方处，此獠何难扑杀之。\n致笏直须还陛下，托孤宁忍负心期。\n好儿好妇言犹在，万死投荒志不移。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37891,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"狄梁公仁杰","author":"张晋","text":"白云亲舍望依依，海曲明珠世所稀。\n妖梦独占双陆谶，孤忠潜挟五龙飞。\n上方宠锡裁金字，制狱奇冤付楮衣。\n闻道宁州诸父老，几人碑下泪齐挥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37892,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五王 桓彦范、敬晖、崔元炜、张柬之、袁恕己","author":"张晋","text":"集仙廊下看横尸，玄武门前复辟时。\n太尉不闻原二吕，五王何故恕三思。\n竹槎缚去情尤惨，葛汁盛来命已危。\n若使当年从季昶，椎床宁悔见机迟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37893,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"张易之张昌宗","author":"张晋","text":"傅粉施朱笑二张，难兄难弟并称郎。\n定知姿貌过怀义，何惜头衔署辟阳。\n三教珠英谁代撰，一时朝士总如狂。\n宫中别有新恩旨，特遣尚书侍阿臧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37894,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宋文贞璟","author":"张晋","text":"中朝第一语非谀，清节棱棱古丈夫。\n独卫东宫拒公主，肯随群小作家奴。\n一时内侍难窥测，万里边功绝觊觎。\n不碍梅花曾作赋，知君铁石世间无。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37895,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"张文献九龄","author":"张晋","text":"少年高第便知名，首谒燕公意已倾。\n曾许文章冠余子，有谁风度似先生。\n知人岂独王夷甫，守正何殊宋广平。\n最是君王西幸日，追思犹自泪纵横。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37896,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"李林甫","author":"张晋","text":"便佞阴柔结主欢，月堂曾致几家残。\n朝廷共庆遗贤少，宰相谁知识字难。\n乌鹊可真巢大理，哥奴何止作郎官。\n满前枳棘君知否，身死宁能免斲棺。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37897,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杨国忠","author":"张晋","text":"闻说君王宠玉环，偶然凭借列高班。\n怙恩尚敢排林甫，蔽王真能反禄山。\n三妹姿容竞天上，五家楼阁杳云间。\n可怜西狩苍黄日，一出延秋竟不还。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37898,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"李临淮光弼","author":"张晋","text":"河阳酣战立奇功，军令三麾百道攻。\n大将宁能污贼手，短刀常自纳靴中。\n穰苴此日威难犯，陶侃当年恨颇同。\n太息程鱼果何物，几将贝锦困英雄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37899,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"房太尉管","author":"张晋","text":"仓卒难当曳落河，高谈因果奈君何。\n更堪琴客能招贿，岂有文人解荷戈。\n士盗虚声成事少，战遵古法误人多。\n义军血变陈涛水，千载伤心杜老歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37900,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"郭汾阳子仪","author":"张晋","text":"功名富贵福能该，手造乾坤列上台。\n君侧不妨群小忌，阵前争看令公来。\n子孙多具封侯相，部曲无非大将才。\n莫道强藩方跋扈，也曾西望拜尘埃。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37901,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"段太尉秀实","author":"张晋","text":"殿前戎服对源休，一击惊看面血流。\n岂有武人能办此，即无逸事亦千秋。\n追兵倒用司农印，植槊高悬悍卒头。\n梁上大绫三百疋，尘封依旧未曾收。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37902,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"李长源泌","author":"张晋","text":"灵武初来未肯臣，军中衣白指山人。\n两京恢复烦前箸，三世师资在一身。\n独慕神仙心自远，处人骨肉语何真。\n至今每诵黄台句，犹忆深宵苦口陈。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37903,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"李西平晟","author":"张晋","text":"孤军支挂竟能存，荡灭群凶奉至尊。\n天实生公为社稷，帝犹念旧到儿孙。\n结欢延赏难消怨，独理元澄解报恩。\n地下老臣应感泣，一封手诏慰忠魂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37904,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"卢杞裴延龄","author":"张晋","text":"潜害忠良复几家，贪人败类势槎拿。\n侍姬肯使窥蓝面，谏议曾闻坏白麻。\n颇识延龄多诞妄，宁知卢杞果奸邪。\n度支宰相原如此，播越流离莫怨嗟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37905,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"刘梦得禹锡柳子厚宗元","author":"张晋","text":"叔文党羽总堪羞，最惜连州与柳州。\n一败那知成大僇，高才毕竟有千秋。\n竹枝歌罢悲迁客，荔子丹时拜故侯。\n悔不当年贞介石，遂教流落弃荒陬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37906,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"田悦","author":"张晋","text":"筑坛建号抗王师，欲效连衡事大奇。\n益土可曾先有兆，此云真是太无知。\n军前痛哭持刀日，帐下要盟断髻时。\n悔不长驱应殄灭，罪归三帅复何辞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37907,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]